        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Fortune &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Gilded Chance</p><p><em>A faint gold shimmer that arrives half a second before anything good happens.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Once per day, reroll one failed check and take the second result.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Twice per day. The reroll gains a <strong>+2 circumstance bonus</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Once per encounter, when an enemy within 30 feet critically succeeds at a save against you, it gets a success instead.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Once per day, after seeing the result, <strong>change one d20 roll made within 30 feet by 5</strong> in either direction &mdash; yours, an ally's, or an enemy's.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
